  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Turn raw Ct values or a QuantStudio/CFX export into checked fold changes: replicate and plasma sample QC (hemolysis, spike-in recovery), normalisation (reference genes with geNorm, spike-in or global mean), ΔΔCt/efficiency-corrected fold changes with group-vs-control statistics, a publication figure, draft methods and results text, an Excel report and a sample-size estimate. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
